{
  "_comment": [
    "Symbol table for Bubbler+. Storage is Unicode; \"slot\" is where the same",
    "mark sits in the bundled symbol font. SimpleGeoDim (assets/SimpleGeoDim.ttf,",
    "SIL OFL, derived from Liberation Sans) has every glyph at its real codepoint,",
    "so slot === unicode throughout and toFont() is an identity. A future face",
    "that puts a glyph elsewhere changes only that row's slot."
  ],
  "font": {
    "family": "SimpleGeoDim",
    "file": "SimpleGeoDim.ttf"
  },
